日本时间11月19日15时过后在当地举行了记者会。\n\n在记者会上，高市就在菲律宾时隔两年举行的日美澳印四国机制“四方安全对话”（Quad）峰会一事强调：“共享基本价值观的民主国家领导人齐聚一堂，就‘战略认知’进行了磨合。在向世界展示为实现自由开放的印度太平洋而形成的坚定团结的同时，还就具体合作达成了一致，此次会议取得了重大成果。”","tg":{"views":1690,"views_label":"1.69K","reactions":[{"emoji":"🤡","count":13,"label":"13"},{"emoji":"🤮","count":4,"label":"4"},{"emoji":"👍","count":2,"label":"2"},{"emoji":"😁","count":2,"label":"2"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113467","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"另一个视角看习近平亲自接机迎接特朗普","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113467","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113467_1.webp","width":180,"height":320},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:55:08+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:10:37+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"另一个视角看习近平亲自接机迎接特朗普","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ddb0f51b4e.mp4?token=dnAMA5553HRqdiHAHRx4cS0y3lzj9Q4LNoupYZ7a7MmLiYUrwzrFl6u2cV0sRxa25tvW2vMWgM9N948_wQ8zx6pjFdyG5n060r8mvxr8XmkqsEq4UiR5xzXV73Ts_5gtuDFc2snIBj2Ocw6vSy46teWzYkCGwt4nySXFNEM-LMkWhoyJBE9L8PiChMLy5kTbo5aKYCRxAMjKuMP3Uu_O7W8q4ssyuxDjl1L41J55nn3rEbdxP2j6CXr7x4QLlN3f7WjOnvQRZZvptJuZ3tQN4dgqFUrjQLCDKKJKQUqSqgPl2X233nlwvFXjggOiy5DMOa3FlJaZIEmiUzZW4AEJVg","preview_url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ZfKb6K3dw7KCaPMFxrpH91FCcQRXJGJQLnd7Sc4nuY0CnDngoAAHwVC49Zu_qp85M07PdLFwR0TNy5cvCasYd8j48Q3ouxByz5fI2Srf86k774cPz8ASug8S1d4oryvOwLaJ3UHelw5E838G7nXOg-inlB4_brc62pt6gxsTAMYeJw1FNKdG4jDrJVN1ZKenP03dbGz2xYi4ZBjxYZmqrLi45FlxxEahMPDyidEBUmyyyc17AK_m4pIsUSJap7yuF8kSTsblCHlCdL-T08yMnSOilBM4efW7OUHGncDHRB2G0nkKUkIw6IGshHmPCxLBmG_XKP2-Q2HLYhZXt7BIqg"}],"views":1760,"views_label":"1.76K","reactions":[{"emoji":"🤝","count":3,"label":"3"},{"emoji":"🥰","count":1,"label":"1"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113466","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"中国跳 YMCA 舞蹈欢迎特朗普","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113466